WEBVTT

01:30.910 --> 01:34.960
[Legend of the Magnate]

01:35.050 --> 01:37.970
[Episode 40]

01:39.229 --> 01:40.289
The way of business

01:40.680 --> 01:42.340
is the way to plan for a nation.

01:42.910 --> 01:45.170
We need to find ways to compete with them.

01:45.350 --> 01:46.560
It's best to go to their territory

01:46.560 --> 01:47.479
to do business.

01:47.759 --> 01:48.950
Make the best use of people,

01:48.950 --> 01:50.610
and the best use of resources.

01:50.750 --> 01:51.910
Perhaps this is

01:52.509 --> 01:54.210
the only way out for us.

01:54.430 --> 01:56.289
At least we won't remain like now,

01:56.310 --> 01:57.280
don't you think?

02:00.240 --> 02:01.130
I can now

02:01.350 --> 02:01.870
see

02:01.870 --> 02:03.280
a vague path ahead.

02:04.070 --> 02:05.800
But I can't explain it clearly.

02:08.470 --> 02:09.600
Do you agree with me?

02:13.190 --> 02:14.000
Partly right,

02:15.120 --> 02:16.120
and partly wrong.

02:16.870 --> 02:18.240
But regardless of right or wrong,

02:18.240 --> 02:19.570
I admire your ambition,

02:19.680 --> 02:20.800
junior.

02:21.400 --> 02:22.420
However,

02:23.030 --> 02:24.690
these things you want to do...

02:25.800 --> 02:26.550
To be honest,

02:26.960 --> 02:29.610
I don't think the Qing Dynasty
can achieve them.

02:29.610 --> 02:30.750
It might be possible

02:30.750 --> 02:31.910
a hundred years

02:32.840 --> 02:33.630
later.

02:34.680 --> 02:35.710
But our generation

02:35.710 --> 02:37.440
certainly won't live to see it.

02:40.470 --> 02:41.160
Alright.

02:41.280 --> 02:42.410
It's getting late,

02:42.630 --> 02:43.690
I should head back.

02:44.190 --> 02:45.850
Let me tell you one last thing.

02:47.800 --> 02:49.200
Quit while you're ahead.

02:49.470 --> 02:50.430
We still have

02:50.470 --> 02:52.400
many years as brothers ahead of us.

02:52.710 --> 02:53.930
Don't find yourself

02:54.360 --> 02:56.290
sacrificing everything too soon.

03:28.280 --> 03:30.750
Ms. Su, you're truly fascinating.

03:31.960 --> 03:32.800
How did you know

03:32.800 --> 03:34.120
I've been looking for you everywhere?

03:34.120 --> 03:35.710
I couldn't help but know.

03:36.470 --> 03:38.470
Everyone in Shanghai is talking about

03:38.470 --> 03:40.630
a wealthy Chinese merchant, Mr. Gu,

03:41.280 --> 03:43.079
who wants to do business abroad.

03:44.280 --> 03:44.800
Yes.

03:45.470 --> 03:47.070
I've prepared all the goods,

03:47.470 --> 03:49.000
but I need a ship.

03:49.400 --> 03:51.280
All merchant ships are British-owned now.

03:51.280 --> 03:52.400
I'm not qualified to rent one,

03:52.400 --> 03:53.960
and they wouldn't rent to me anyway.

03:53.960 --> 03:54.910
Then I suddenly remembered that

03:54.910 --> 03:57.150
you have a military ship, Ms. Su.

03:58.750 --> 04:01.080
What makes you think
I would rent it to you?

04:02.840 --> 04:03.710
I believe you

04:03.710 --> 04:05.400
wouldn't stand by and watch

04:05.520 --> 04:06.870
Li Qin become a traitor.

04:10.870 --> 04:12.470
Actually, I'm very curious.

04:12.630 --> 04:13.710
Ms. Su, you're friendly

04:13.710 --> 04:14.840
with one person at one moment,

04:14.840 --> 04:16.300
and with another the next,

04:16.720 --> 04:18.070
like a chameleon.

04:18.269 --> 04:19.269
I wonder why.

04:21.829 --> 04:23.560
How long have you been curious?

04:24.390 --> 04:25.850
I've always been curious.

04:34.000 --> 04:34.680
You must know

04:34.680 --> 04:36.070
about my father, right?

04:37.560 --> 04:38.870
His entire family was executed,

04:38.870 --> 04:40.730
and his nine clans exterminated.

04:41.310 --> 04:42.510
Many royal relatives

04:43.000 --> 04:44.680
were Catholics.

04:45.510 --> 04:47.770
My adoptive father was a Western bishop.

04:48.270 --> 04:49.310
Back then,

04:49.480 --> 04:51.630
I was sent to Hong Kong

04:51.630 --> 04:53.230
with the help of his friends.

04:53.750 --> 04:56.560
Later, I was sent
to serve the Heavenly King.

04:57.270 --> 04:58.870
I contacted old acquaintances

04:58.870 --> 05:01.000
and gathered military intelligence.

05:03.040 --> 05:05.370
Unfortunately, the Heavenly King failed

05:05.800 --> 05:07.800
and destroyed years of foundation.

05:08.190 --> 05:10.120
Though the Heavenly Kingdom fell,

05:10.240 --> 05:12.000
my sworn enemies remain.

05:12.800 --> 05:14.560
The Qing Dynasty's days are numbered.

05:14.560 --> 05:15.680
At that time,

05:16.310 --> 05:18.240
I secretly moved useful talents

05:18.240 --> 05:19.300
out of the country.

05:20.600 --> 05:21.630
I don't know what the Qing Dynasty

05:21.630 --> 05:22.750
will become.

05:23.270 --> 05:25.070
But whatever it becomes,

05:26.070 --> 05:28.070
it will be better than what it is now.

05:32.000 --> 05:33.460
Let's talk about the ship.

05:34.070 --> 05:35.270
I do have

05:35.270 --> 05:36.400
a ship at my disposal

05:36.540 --> 05:37.670
that money can rent.

05:38.270 --> 05:39.760
A Portuguese gunboat

05:39.920 --> 05:41.440
is big enough for your cargo.

05:41.440 --> 05:42.580
But the problem is,

05:43.120 --> 05:45.310
you're not qualified to rent it.

05:45.960 --> 05:47.200
Your goods

05:47.480 --> 05:49.040
need to be officially handled

05:49.040 --> 05:50.360
by a foreign merchant.

05:50.630 --> 05:51.600
He'll be the captain,

05:51.600 --> 05:53.460
and you'll be the Chinese master.

05:56.560 --> 05:58.020
But who are you planning to

05:58.040 --> 05:59.510
sell the goods to in India?

06:01.120 --> 06:02.000
What makes you think

06:02.000 --> 06:02.830
I was going to sell

06:02.830 --> 06:03.830
my goods in India?

06:04.240 --> 06:05.390
The God of Wealth has connections with

06:05.390 --> 06:06.750
some British merchants.

06:06.750 --> 06:08.310
He has already made arrangements for me.

06:08.310 --> 06:09.120
This time,

06:09.870 --> 06:10.630
I want to break through

06:10.630 --> 06:12.390
the East India Company's blockade

06:12.390 --> 06:13.430
and sell our goods

06:13.430 --> 06:14.630
directly to Britain.

06:16.340 --> 06:18.150
How unexpected.

06:25.950 --> 06:28.160
I'll arrange a meeting
with the captain tomorrow.

06:28.160 --> 06:28.720
Bring along

06:28.720 --> 06:30.680
the British merchant receiving the goods
with you,

06:30.680 --> 06:32.880
and both parties can sign the contract.

06:33.070 --> 06:34.620
This might be the very first

06:34.680 --> 06:35.940
contract in the world.

06:36.510 --> 06:37.470
The first one

06:38.159 --> 06:39.750
that allows a Chinese merchant

06:39.750 --> 06:41.070
to conduct overseas business

06:41.070 --> 06:42.750
in his personal capacity.

06:44.720 --> 06:45.650
How remarkable.

06:49.360 --> 06:50.120
Ms. Su.

06:53.950 --> 06:54.600
Thank you.

06:57.870 --> 07:00.310
After the contract is signed,
I'll have to worry about

07:00.310 --> 07:01.070
protecting

07:01.070 --> 07:02.600
that foolish head of yours.

07:20.510 --> 07:21.000
Yu'er.

07:25.190 --> 07:26.390
What brings you back?

07:37.920 --> 07:38.920
I miss our child.

07:42.630 --> 07:43.750
Do you think

07:44.120 --> 07:46.000
it's a son or a daughter?

07:47.070 --> 07:47.830
Either a son

07:49.360 --> 07:50.560
or a daughter is fine.

07:51.300 --> 07:54.100
What matters most is that
you and the baby are safe.

07:55.510 --> 07:56.970
I've been away for so long.

07:58.430 --> 07:59.690
I miss you both so much.

08:13.040 --> 08:14.070
How did

08:15.360 --> 08:16.270
everything go?

08:18.360 --> 08:19.160
It went fine.

08:20.950 --> 08:21.720
Madam,

08:21.830 --> 08:23.040
someone from the
Liangjiang Viceroy's Office

08:23.040 --> 08:24.300
is asking to see Mr. Gu.

08:28.090 --> 08:29.850
How are they so informed?

08:30.270 --> 08:31.870
They know as soon as I'm back.

08:33.010 --> 08:33.690
Mr. Gu,

08:34.150 --> 08:35.809
His Excellency requests your presence
at his residence.

08:35.809 --> 08:36.669
It's urgent.

08:38.710 --> 08:40.240
Look how important you are.

08:41.000 --> 08:42.000
I'll be back soon.

08:57.850 --> 08:58.980
Wield it if you want.

09:00.360 --> 09:01.820
Just don't hurt yourself.

09:36.540 --> 09:37.800
Don't make a move here.

09:45.100 --> 09:45.760
Let's go.

10:09.040 --> 10:10.320
I have questions for you.

10:10.320 --> 10:11.840
Answer truthfully

10:11.910 --> 10:13.930
to avoid physical suffering.

10:13.980 --> 10:15.630
Whether my words are true or not,

10:15.630 --> 10:17.290
it's still up to you to decide.

10:18.360 --> 10:20.650
Come on, show him the torture instruments.

10:20.650 --> 10:21.980
[Clear Rivers and Ringing Shrines]

10:25.860 --> 10:26.730
Gu Pingyuan,

10:27.120 --> 10:28.320
you're a smart man.

10:28.090 --> 10:31.570
[Loyal to the Country, Just in Duty]

10:29.150 --> 10:30.630
Don't make me ask twice.

10:32.030 --> 10:33.550
Otherwise, this physical torture

10:33.550 --> 10:35.210
will be more than you can bear.

10:35.480 --> 10:36.140
Now tell me.

10:36.510 --> 10:37.240
Where did you get

10:37.240 --> 10:39.120
all those taels of silver you spent

10:39.120 --> 10:40.250
to import the goods?

10:41.390 --> 10:42.190
From a friend.

10:43.360 --> 10:45.090
That's not a good answer, is it?

10:47.440 --> 10:48.030
Guards.

10:48.270 --> 10:49.000
Torture him.

10:50.380 --> 10:51.630
[Clear Rivers and Ringing Shrines]

10:56.040 --> 10:57.190
[Loyal to the Country, Just in Duty]

11:03.980 --> 11:04.940
[Loyal to the Country, Just in Duty]

11:09.970 --> 11:11.470
[Clear Rivers and Ringing Shrines]

11:14.080 --> 11:14.630
Enough!

11:17.150 --> 11:17.720
Enough.

11:22.710 --> 11:25.030
[Clear Rivers and Ringing Shrines]

11:32.910 --> 11:33.960
Let's see...

11:34.630 --> 11:36.780
The tea you imported from Anhui

11:37.150 --> 11:39.510
amounts to 7 million taels.

11:38.520 --> 11:40.940
[Clear Rivers and Ringing Shrines]

11:41.200 --> 11:43.750
The medicinal herbs you imported
from Shanxi alone,

11:43.750 --> 11:45.030
mainly rhubarb,

11:45.510 --> 11:48.200
amount to over 1 million taels.

11:48.300 --> 11:52.340
[Loyal to the Country, Just in Duty]

11:48.670 --> 11:50.390
From the Wu family in Hangzhou,

11:50.390 --> 11:52.670
you imported raw silk and embroidery

11:52.670 --> 11:54.960
worth an enormous 7 million taels.

11:56.600 --> 11:58.440
What a massive business deal!

11:59.630 --> 12:00.550
Moreover,

12:00.790 --> 12:02.480
you paid with banknotes

12:03.240 --> 12:04.790
on the spot.

12:06.600 --> 12:08.260
Where did the money come from?

12:10.870 --> 12:15.040
[Clear Rivers and Ringing Shrines]

12:11.910 --> 12:13.320
Don't rush to answer.

12:13.910 --> 12:15.750
Wait until I finish my questions.

12:15.750 --> 12:17.120
How did those

12:17.120 --> 12:18.600
shady friends of yours

12:18.600 --> 12:19.550
in Shanxi suddenly acquire

12:19.550 --> 12:21.270
so much gold and silver treasure

12:21.270 --> 12:22.840
to send to the mint

12:22.870 --> 12:24.670
and convert into so much silver?

12:25.480 --> 12:26.840
Where is the treasure hidden?

12:26.390 --> 12:28.250
[Loyal to the Country, Just in Duty]

12:32.360 --> 12:35.260
How much annual revenue
does the Qing Dynasty have?

12:35.390 --> 12:37.000
You are a businessman

12:37.000 --> 12:38.260
as wealthy as a nation.

12:39.670 --> 12:41.670
My every business deal

12:44.670 --> 12:46.240
has been helping you.

12:47.390 --> 12:48.430
But this is how

12:49.150 --> 12:50.510
you treat me?

12:53.130 --> 12:54.480
[Clear Rivers and Ringing Shrines]

12:55.790 --> 12:57.630
I have to ask.

12:58.270 --> 13:00.750
Even the Empress Dowager
knows about it now.

13:01.270 --> 13:02.670
I've seen many people

13:02.750 --> 13:04.080
with wealthy families.

13:04.240 --> 13:06.030
But someone like you

13:06.120 --> 13:07.480
who can fork out

13:07.480 --> 13:08.670
10 to 20 million taels

13:08.670 --> 13:10.070
without breaking a sweat

13:10.080 --> 13:11.150
to import so many goods

13:11.150 --> 13:12.480
in a few days?

13:12.790 --> 13:14.510
I've never met someone like that.

13:14.510 --> 13:16.510
It's better that I question you now.

13:16.510 --> 13:17.670
If I can't get answers,

13:17.670 --> 13:19.120
I'll send you to Beijing.

13:19.910 --> 13:21.440
Those people

13:21.720 --> 13:23.390
won't be as polite as I am.

13:26.900 --> 13:30.270
[Clear Rivers and Ringing Shrines]

13:27.670 --> 13:30.440
I'm begging you, please tell me.

13:32.910 --> 13:34.110
Those salt fields...

13:34.790 --> 13:36.120
Do you still want them?

13:38.080 --> 13:38.910
You claim to be

13:38.910 --> 13:41.960
concerned about the livelihood
in Liangjiang and Lianghuai.

13:41.960 --> 13:42.820
What happened?

13:43.480 --> 13:44.600
Was it all a lie?

13:46.030 --> 13:47.390
Not necessarily a lie.

13:47.910 --> 13:50.030
Even if foreigners take them away,

13:50.480 --> 13:52.080
I have ways to deal with it.

13:52.510 --> 13:53.480
At worst,

13:53.480 --> 13:55.000
I'll just face a scolding.

13:55.200 --> 13:57.060
But you've really frightened me.

13:57.120 --> 13:57.790
Gu,

13:58.030 --> 13:59.510
what exactly are you trying to do?

13:59.510 --> 14:00.270
Where did your

14:00.270 --> 14:01.720
money come from?

14:04.840 --> 14:06.770
You've been watching me all along.

14:07.360 --> 14:08.750
It's not me.

14:09.000 --> 14:10.960
Someone else is watching you.

14:11.550 --> 14:13.360
Someone has reported to the emperor,

14:13.360 --> 14:15.820
and the brass has ordered
an investigation.

14:16.270 --> 14:17.440
What can I do?

14:20.590 --> 14:28.550
[Righteous and Diligent]

14:21.790 --> 14:22.390
Guards!

14:22.840 --> 14:23.840
-Yes.
-Yes.

14:24.390 --> 14:25.320
Help me up first.

14:25.440 --> 14:26.100
Right away.

14:28.630 --> 14:31.570
[Clear Rivers and Ringing Shrines]

14:30.910 --> 14:31.910
Alright, enough.

14:32.000 --> 14:33.510
Take him to prison.

14:33.600 --> 14:35.660
Prepare to escort him to the capital.

14:39.570 --> 14:44.400
[Clear Rivers and Ringing Shrines]

14:47.550 --> 14:49.680
By order of the Viceroy of Liangjiang.

14:49.840 --> 14:51.040
Upon investigation,

14:51.120 --> 14:53.720
merchant Gu Pingyuan, being a fugitive,

14:53.770 --> 14:55.670
has accumulated wealth of dubious origin

14:55.670 --> 14:57.670
and violated our nation's commercial laws.

14:57.670 --> 14:58.510
In the coming days,

14:58.510 --> 14:59.840
he shall be sent to the capital in chains,

14:59.840 --> 15:01.910
and all his property shall be confiscated.

15:01.910 --> 15:03.150
You two, move faster!

15:06.630 --> 15:07.760
Everyone, hurry up!

15:09.030 --> 15:09.840
Do you have any

15:09.870 --> 15:10.730
hidden assets?

15:11.750 --> 15:12.960
Even this house

15:13.200 --> 15:15.840
is just borrowed from
the Liangjiang Viceroy's Office.

15:15.840 --> 15:16.970
Go ahead and search.

15:17.200 --> 15:17.910
Men,

15:18.150 --> 15:19.270
search everything!

15:19.270 --> 15:20.400
Search thoroughly.

15:20.600 --> 15:21.910
Don't miss any corner.

15:22.240 --> 15:22.960
Yes, sir!

15:26.960 --> 15:27.880
In the end,

15:28.870 --> 15:30.070
it comes down to this.

15:32.840 --> 15:34.650
Being able to stir up Liangjiang

15:34.790 --> 15:36.270
and shock the imperial court

15:36.270 --> 15:38.500
is quite an impressive feat.

15:38.750 --> 15:40.950
Who else would they raid if not his home?

15:42.670 --> 15:43.630
At a time like this,

15:43.630 --> 15:45.020
you can still smile?

15:45.630 --> 15:46.990
I can't believe you.

15:48.790 --> 15:49.840
If I don't smile,

15:49.840 --> 15:51.040
should I cry instead?

15:55.600 --> 15:57.060
Did you see him yesterday?

15:57.440 --> 15:58.430
Just briefly.

15:59.240 --> 16:01.480
People were around,
so we couldn't talk much.

16:01.480 --> 16:03.650
He just asked how you and the child
were doing.

16:03.650 --> 16:06.110
He wants you to wait for him
to name the child.

16:11.390 --> 16:12.920
He's about to lose his head,

16:13.510 --> 16:16.110
and he's still thinking
about naming the baby.

16:16.150 --> 16:17.360
Such a carefree man.

16:21.270 --> 16:22.790
After they finish the confiscation,

16:22.790 --> 16:24.050
we'll return to Anhui.

16:24.870 --> 16:26.830
This time, they only
mentioned confiscation.

16:26.830 --> 16:28.480
Nothing about sending the whole family

16:28.480 --> 16:29.790
to Beijing in chains.

16:30.240 --> 16:31.600
Pingwen has hired a carriage.

16:31.600 --> 16:32.660
It'll be here soon.

16:38.240 --> 16:41.500
Which one of you is the head
of the family? Please sign here.

17:00.360 --> 17:00.960
Slow down.

17:06.400 --> 17:07.589
His Excellency has asked me

17:07.589 --> 17:08.920
to give it to you, madam.

17:13.720 --> 17:14.640
What is this?

17:21.180 --> 17:24.130
[Shares of Salt Industry Guild]

17:27.400 --> 17:30.200
This is the share
of the Salt Industry Guild.

17:32.110 --> 17:33.710
This is money to buy his life.

17:35.400 --> 17:36.260
I don't want it.

17:38.960 --> 17:39.960
Keep it safe.

17:40.240 --> 17:42.480
Let him decide if he wants it.

17:50.750 --> 17:52.350
Can he still make decisions?

17:52.430 --> 17:53.070
Yes.

17:53.400 --> 17:54.400
He still needs to come back

17:54.400 --> 17:56.040
to name the child.

17:56.200 --> 17:57.260
Don't cry anymore.

17:57.310 --> 17:57.790
Heizi.

17:58.110 --> 17:59.090
Let's go back to Anhui.

17:59.090 --> 17:59.620
Alright.

18:19.350 --> 18:20.480
Have you seen Li Qin?

18:20.510 --> 18:21.440
He's over there.

18:21.920 --> 18:22.480
Li.

18:24.720 --> 18:27.200
Look at this. Look at this.

18:29.960 --> 18:31.440
You don't speak English.

18:31.750 --> 18:33.280
Translator? Translator!

18:37.400 --> 18:39.000
The telegram says it's been confirmed.

18:39.000 --> 18:40.270
This Portuguese warship

18:40.270 --> 18:41.400
was hired by a Chinese merchant

18:41.400 --> 18:42.720
as a cargo ship bound for Britain,

18:42.720 --> 18:44.310
loaded with raw silk, silk fabrics,

18:44.310 --> 18:45.440
rhubarb, and tea leaves.

18:45.440 --> 18:46.720
Merchants from many countries

18:46.720 --> 18:47.680
are very interested in it.

18:47.680 --> 18:49.110
There's sufficient evidence

18:49.110 --> 18:50.240
to prove that

18:50.240 --> 18:51.510
a Chinese merchant surnamed Gu

18:51.510 --> 18:52.270
is behind this ship.

18:52.270 --> 18:53.330
Do you understand?

18:53.350 --> 18:53.830
Li.

18:56.070 --> 18:57.600
Then what are you afraid of?

19:00.920 --> 19:02.380
If this Merchant Gu

19:02.440 --> 19:04.110
delivers this cargo ship to Britain,

19:04.110 --> 19:05.720
he may master the shipping routes

19:05.720 --> 19:07.350
and ship to more distant places.

19:07.350 --> 19:09.270
Then, I would have created
a formidable rival

19:09.270 --> 19:10.800
for the East India Company.

19:11.830 --> 19:13.680
I'll have to return to my hometown
in Liverpool

19:13.680 --> 19:14.880
and enjoy my pension.

19:14.930 --> 19:16.230
-And it's unacceptable.
-Why didn’t you protest

19:16.230 --> 19:17.560
to the Chinese Emperor?

19:20.270 --> 19:21.000
They used our

19:21.000 --> 19:22.030
competitor's name

19:22.030 --> 19:22.880
to pick up the cargo.

19:22.880 --> 19:24.410
He's very sneaky, you know.

19:25.960 --> 19:28.090
Now there's no way I can stop this ship.

19:28.110 --> 19:29.640
This will be a disaster if this ship

19:29.640 --> 19:31.840
-makes it to Britain.
-What do we do now?

19:32.790 --> 19:33.640
You must come to the

19:33.640 --> 19:35.240
Governor's Mansion with me.

19:35.350 --> 19:35.920
Now.

19:38.560 --> 19:40.950
[Liangjiang Viceroy's Office]

19:40.110 --> 19:42.240
We strongly protest.

19:42.350 --> 19:43.640
We strongly protest.

19:44.790 --> 19:46.070
Alright, welcome.

19:46.070 --> 19:46.650
Yes, yes.

19:46.680 --> 19:47.310
Yes, yes.

19:47.750 --> 19:48.350
Welcome.

19:52.680 --> 19:54.510
This is a shameless trampling

19:54.510 --> 19:56.710
on the commercial order of the Far East.

19:57.590 --> 19:58.790
Where is the Far East?

19:59.350 --> 20:00.430
It's the Qing Dynasty

20:00.430 --> 20:02.030
What about the Qing Dynasty?

20:02.230 --> 20:05.030
What about the Qing Dynasty,
which is the Far East?

20:08.010 --> 20:10.110
The commercial order
is seriously disrupted.

20:10.110 --> 20:10.770
Disrupted?

20:11.160 --> 20:12.960
What are the business orders?

20:14.310 --> 20:15.420
What are the business...

20:15.420 --> 20:16.160
You don't know

20:16.160 --> 20:17.820
what the business orders are?

20:18.640 --> 20:21.380
The business order is

20:21.410 --> 20:21.790
what he means by...

20:21.790 --> 20:22.930
Business order is just like

20:22.930 --> 20:24.830
the order among Chinese officials.

20:24.830 --> 20:27.090
Lower officials obey higher officials,

20:27.270 --> 20:29.270
higher officials obey the Emperor,

20:29.440 --> 20:31.100
and the Emperor obeys Heaven.

20:32.360 --> 20:33.950
Look at that.

20:33.980 --> 20:35.160
Once he explains it like this,

20:35.160 --> 20:36.720
we all understand.

20:36.830 --> 20:37.830
In our place,

20:37.830 --> 20:39.030
we respect order.

20:39.270 --> 20:40.920
You see, he is protesting,

20:40.920 --> 20:42.590
and we understand completely.

20:42.590 --> 20:43.110
We have already

20:43.110 --> 20:44.590
sent the person you mentioned

20:44.590 --> 20:46.590
to prison in the Far East.

20:48.270 --> 20:50.000
That does not matter!

20:51.850 --> 20:52.780
Mr. Richard says

20:52.810 --> 20:53.830
that's not important.

20:53.830 --> 20:55.000
The cargo ship in Shanghai

20:55.000 --> 20:55.920
must be stopped

20:55.960 --> 20:57.760
and the voyage must be canceled.

20:59.590 --> 21:01.110
As far as I know,

21:02.000 --> 21:02.930
our Qing Dynasty

21:03.000 --> 21:04.270
didn't have any ships

21:04.270 --> 21:05.540
sent out to sea.

21:06.220 --> 21:07.550
You've misunderstood.

21:07.590 --> 21:08.780
No, no, no.

21:08.960 --> 21:10.590
The denial is useless.

21:11.640 --> 21:13.200
The denial is useless.

21:13.270 --> 21:14.270
He demands

21:14.270 --> 21:16.200
an equal commercial negotiation.

21:20.000 --> 21:21.800
That's not a nice way to put it.

21:23.960 --> 21:25.480
Aren't we

21:25.720 --> 21:27.240
negotiating right now?

21:27.480 --> 21:30.600
We understand your protest.

21:30.750 --> 21:32.400
I've arrested the man

21:32.510 --> 21:34.610
and sent him to the Far East prison.

21:35.160 --> 21:35.750
But

21:35.750 --> 21:38.120
as for your request to stop

21:38.640 --> 21:39.400
that ship,

21:40.240 --> 21:41.340
that's a

21:41.440 --> 21:43.410
Portuguese warship.

21:43.920 --> 21:45.670
The British hired it.

21:45.750 --> 21:47.240
How could I possibly

21:47.350 --> 21:49.010
have the authority to stop it?

21:49.590 --> 21:51.390
You've come to the wrong person.

21:52.750 --> 21:54.310
Mr. Richard wants to know

21:55.830 --> 21:56.830
if Gu Pingyuan

21:56.830 --> 21:57.960
is really in prison.

22:00.160 --> 22:01.030
Of course he is.

22:01.400 --> 22:02.890
He's just been tortured.

22:04.010 --> 22:05.130
Alright, guards!

22:06.310 --> 22:07.160
Take this gentleman

22:07.160 --> 22:07.920
to the Far East

22:07.920 --> 22:09.240
prison to have a look.

22:10.110 --> 22:11.960
He's taking us to see him in jail.

22:13.400 --> 22:14.060
Thank you.

22:14.550 --> 22:15.410
Thank you, Sir.

22:32.680 --> 22:33.550
He's here.

22:38.720 --> 22:39.590
Gu Pingyuan.

22:43.200 --> 22:45.350
Your property has been confiscated,

22:46.440 --> 22:48.070
and you've been imprisoned.

22:48.720 --> 22:50.450
You're even worse off than I am.

22:51.000 --> 22:53.130
Look at those people you were loyal to.

22:54.030 --> 22:55.890
See how they're treating you now,

22:56.480 --> 22:58.080
and how they're treating me.

22:58.480 --> 23:00.510
You are truly hilarious.

23:11.790 --> 23:12.640
Mr. Gu.

23:15.070 --> 23:15.720
Lord Gu.

23:16.440 --> 23:17.850
He represents the East India Company

23:17.850 --> 23:18.840
to inform you.

23:19.830 --> 23:21.640
They want to negotiate with you

23:21.720 --> 23:23.780
to purchase the goods from that ship.

23:24.790 --> 23:26.480
The situation you're in now

23:26.680 --> 23:28.280
is not in your best interest.

23:29.240 --> 23:29.880
Discussing these matters

23:29.880 --> 23:30.920
is pointless now.

23:32.350 --> 23:33.310
Say something useful.

23:33.310 --> 23:34.310
There's no need

23:34.310 --> 23:35.720
to discuss these questions.

23:35.720 --> 23:37.070
Say something useful.

23:38.880 --> 23:40.350
What do you want?

23:41.070 --> 23:42.310
What do you want?

23:43.640 --> 23:45.240
I've already paid the money.

23:45.640 --> 23:46.640
Within two days,

23:48.030 --> 23:49.680
if you don't return
our salt fields' title deeds

23:49.680 --> 23:50.880
exactly as they were,

23:51.650 --> 23:53.020
that ship with the cargo

23:53.960 --> 23:55.220
will sail on schedule.

23:57.760 --> 23:59.110
Damn it!

24:00.880 --> 24:02.110
This is a trap set by

24:02.110 --> 24:03.640
the Viceroy and you!

24:10.550 --> 24:11.310
Mr. Hart.

24:11.440 --> 24:12.310
Mr. Richard.

24:12.960 --> 24:13.620
Have a seat.

24:18.960 --> 24:20.120
Mr. Hart.

24:20.750 --> 24:23.070
I heard that you're involved with my...

24:23.240 --> 24:24.590
wager with

24:24.920 --> 24:26.350
the Governor of Liangjiang.

24:26.350 --> 24:27.830
Wager? What Wager?

24:28.550 --> 24:29.960
You mean the salt fields.

24:30.030 --> 24:30.510
Yes!

24:31.070 --> 24:32.030
Indeed.

24:32.470 --> 24:35.240
You've been a little
hotheaded recently, huh?

24:36.000 --> 24:37.000
Mr. Hart.

24:37.830 --> 24:38.960
I respect you

24:39.640 --> 24:41.830
as a veteran in this business.

24:42.400 --> 24:44.640
But you must respect

24:44.680 --> 24:46.110
the influence of the East

24:46.110 --> 24:48.030
India Company here in China.

24:49.270 --> 24:52.030
In the dispute over a property mortgage,

24:52.160 --> 24:54.820
the responsibility is quite clear.

24:54.920 --> 24:57.160
It is those Chinese officials

24:57.240 --> 24:59.640
who are evading and denying.

25:00.240 --> 25:02.120
And I hope Mr. Hart

25:02.270 --> 25:05.000
will objectively address that issue.

25:09.720 --> 25:12.890
I am employed by the Qing government

25:13.160 --> 25:15.430
as the head of the Customs.

25:15.480 --> 25:18.840
I'm in charge of all
import and export businesses.

25:19.590 --> 25:21.790
I believe I have been very objective

25:21.790 --> 25:23.070
in treating your company

25:23.070 --> 25:25.070
and I've never meddled in the normal

25:25.270 --> 25:26.730
business of your company.

25:26.920 --> 25:30.050
Now this accusation of yours...
Where does it come from?

25:31.400 --> 25:32.310
This all

25:32.430 --> 25:33.960
is a breach of agreements.

25:34.030 --> 25:35.790
We do not mind the competition.

25:36.020 --> 25:37.880
But if a Chinese merchant

25:37.960 --> 25:40.350
will independently disobey

25:40.590 --> 25:42.040
his government's law

25:42.110 --> 25:43.790
and openly provoke us...

25:44.750 --> 25:46.680
If it weren't for your connivance,

25:46.750 --> 25:49.590
do you think he would have done it?

25:52.000 --> 25:53.000
I understand.

25:53.640 --> 25:55.440
Now, I'd like to ask you.

25:55.480 --> 25:57.240
In all of this business,

25:58.680 --> 25:59.680
what did I do?

26:03.350 --> 26:04.060
Come on.

26:04.550 --> 26:05.790
I thought you said you were

26:05.790 --> 26:07.590
not afraid of some competition.

26:07.590 --> 26:09.650
We aren't afraid of the competition.

26:10.510 --> 26:11.480
There are many goods,

26:11.480 --> 26:13.110
but they're not enough

26:13.270 --> 26:15.360
to impact our company's market.

26:16.480 --> 26:17.590
But my friend,

26:17.680 --> 26:19.720
this impacts you, huh?

26:27.640 --> 26:28.160
What?

26:28.920 --> 26:30.360
You little monkey,

26:30.570 --> 26:32.630
think you're something special now?

26:34.240 --> 26:35.960
Both my legs are bruised now.

26:41.030 --> 26:43.240
I had to use some force.

26:44.960 --> 26:47.480
That Richard

26:47.920 --> 26:50.430
is complaining everywhere like a mad dog.

26:53.440 --> 26:54.990
If this matter succeeds,

26:55.400 --> 26:56.860
I'll give you a big reward.

27:02.110 --> 27:03.720
Just let me go back to Anhui.

27:05.720 --> 27:07.720
I won't stay in Liangjiang for long.

27:07.790 --> 27:10.440
Liangjiang has recovered well
these past two years.

27:10.440 --> 27:11.350
Jiu has also

27:11.370 --> 27:12.590
disbanded

27:12.590 --> 27:13.650
most of his troops.

27:13.680 --> 27:15.410
A tiger without claws and teeth

27:15.720 --> 27:16.920
is no longer a threat.

27:17.070 --> 27:18.960
The imperial court wants me back,

27:19.350 --> 27:21.720
perhaps as a Grand Councillor,

27:22.070 --> 27:23.730
or perhaps for nothing at all.

27:24.070 --> 27:27.000
The imperial court wants to establish
a Ministry of Commerce.

27:27.000 --> 27:27.590
They've decreed

27:27.590 --> 27:30.270
that we senior officials
make recommendations.

27:30.270 --> 27:30.870
I think...

27:32.240 --> 27:32.920
Look at you.

27:34.240 --> 27:35.790
You said it yourself.

27:35.880 --> 27:37.480
Business serves the nation.

27:37.680 --> 27:38.790
Aren't you more suited

27:38.790 --> 27:39.640
for this position than

27:39.640 --> 27:41.070
those officials who know nothing

27:41.070 --> 27:42.000
about business?

27:42.810 --> 27:44.410
If someone else got this job,

27:44.510 --> 27:46.910
they'd wake up laughing from their dreams.

27:48.680 --> 27:49.960
When I think about it,

27:50.920 --> 27:52.920
I've handled quite a lot of silver

27:53.680 --> 27:54.790
in my lifetime.

27:57.310 --> 27:58.310
But only when I was

27:58.310 --> 27:59.720
growing tea in Anhui,

28:00.440 --> 28:01.700
did I feel most at peace

28:02.160 --> 28:02.920
and happy.

28:05.200 --> 28:07.260
Business serving the nation is true,

28:08.680 --> 28:10.680
but only if the nation can be served.

28:13.240 --> 28:14.510
Even with your position

28:14.510 --> 28:16.170
as the Viceroy of Liangjiang,

28:16.270 --> 28:18.480
you can't handle those foreign merchants.

28:18.480 --> 28:19.940
What makes you think I can?

28:21.240 --> 28:22.830
We're considered friends,

28:23.160 --> 28:24.720
so tell me the truth.

28:25.400 --> 28:26.070
I know

28:26.270 --> 28:28.440
you used cash for all your purchases.

28:29.310 --> 28:30.970
Where did the money come from?

28:31.310 --> 28:32.240
You want to know?

28:32.400 --> 28:34.000
I'm curious.

28:34.720 --> 28:37.310
The imperial court asked me
to report back carefully.

28:37.310 --> 28:39.030
I certainly can't lie,

28:39.240 --> 28:39.720
can I?

28:40.110 --> 28:41.590
Minister of Commerce?

28:42.750 --> 28:44.000
This is no gift.

28:44.680 --> 28:46.270
This is a death warrant.

28:48.700 --> 28:51.340
What's the use of wealth and status?

28:51.640 --> 28:52.880
You're right.

28:53.160 --> 28:54.680
Just tell me.

29:44.160 --> 29:45.070
I believe Gu Pingyuan

29:45.070 --> 29:46.110
has invested all his fortune

29:46.110 --> 29:47.000
to make this happen.

29:47.000 --> 29:48.350
But the cargo of one ship,

29:48.350 --> 29:48.750
no matter how much,

29:48.750 --> 29:49.920
cannot possibly impact

29:49.920 --> 29:51.030
the East India Company commercially.

29:51.030 --> 29:52.550
If you can persevere

29:53.000 --> 29:54.400
and obtain the operating rights
to the Lianghuai salt industry,

29:54.400 --> 29:55.930
do you know what that means?

29:55.940 --> 29:57.110
You will get one-fifth

29:57.110 --> 29:59.570
of the Qing Dynasty's official industries.

29:59.680 --> 30:00.510
Using this as a stepping stone,

30:00.510 --> 30:01.030
you can acquire

30:01.030 --> 30:02.290
immeasurable wealth.

30:02.550 --> 30:03.510
You must trust me.

30:03.510 --> 30:04.480
This is the biggest threat

30:04.480 --> 30:05.510
he could think of.

30:06.070 --> 30:07.550
This isn't a business move.

30:07.550 --> 30:08.920
It's not even clever.

30:11.070 --> 30:13.510
This is a Chinese-style tactic.

30:14.350 --> 30:16.590
Li, do you know what you're saying?

30:16.590 --> 30:17.270
I do.

30:19.000 --> 30:21.480
Rather than being manipulated
by bureaucrats,

30:21.480 --> 30:22.750
I'd prefer fairness.

30:28.270 --> 30:29.240
Between us,

30:29.920 --> 30:31.380
fairness is not an option.

30:31.880 --> 30:33.210
You're just one person.

30:34.310 --> 30:35.750
I have at least one ship.

31:41.000 --> 31:41.480
Please.

31:47.640 --> 31:48.480
Come, please.

32:10.720 --> 32:12.030
That merchant named Gu

32:12.030 --> 32:13.490
has finally quieted down.

32:14.440 --> 32:15.680
The imperial court has severely

32:15.680 --> 32:16.670
punished him.

32:17.830 --> 32:19.160
However, that shipment

32:19.160 --> 32:21.350
was still handled by Mr. Hart

32:21.400 --> 32:22.530
as an intermediary,

32:22.810 --> 32:23.440
and eventually

32:23.440 --> 32:25.400
sold to the East India Company.

32:26.680 --> 32:27.920
Xianghe Trade House

32:28.750 --> 32:30.550
has achieved remarkable success.

32:30.550 --> 32:32.070
Congratulations indeed.

32:43.350 --> 32:44.070
Cunning.

32:44.440 --> 32:45.210
Cunning.

32:45.670 --> 32:47.110
Likewise.

32:47.960 --> 32:48.560
Well then.

32:51.110 --> 32:51.640
Alright.

32:54.730 --> 32:56.730
Alright, gentlemen, look this way.

32:57.200 --> 32:59.680
-Ready.
-Three, two, one.

33:08.040 --> 33:08.850
Mr. Gu.

33:10.790 --> 33:13.680
Mr. Gu, congratulations!

33:16.440 --> 33:17.840
Congratulations to you!

33:18.720 --> 33:19.510
Mr. Gu.

33:19.960 --> 33:21.890
The salt field has been reclaimed.

33:23.720 --> 33:25.610
I'll ask you one last time.

33:25.680 --> 33:27.340
Where did the money come from?

33:31.310 --> 33:32.070
Or else?

33:32.590 --> 33:33.590
Or else,

33:33.830 --> 33:35.200
you'll be sent to the capital in shackles.

33:35.200 --> 33:36.590
They'll have your head.

33:41.160 --> 33:41.720
Look.

33:42.510 --> 33:43.400
Is it sturdy?

33:43.790 --> 33:44.520
It is sturdy.

33:45.590 --> 33:46.200
As for me,

33:46.400 --> 33:49.070
I'm keeping my head to enjoy
a few more years of drinking.

33:49.070 --> 33:51.070
So I'm afraid you'll have to suffer.

33:51.590 --> 33:52.160
Guards!

33:52.440 --> 33:53.350
Take him to the capital in shackles!

33:53.350 --> 33:53.920
Yes, sir!

33:56.000 --> 33:58.550
I just received orders
from the imperial court.

33:58.550 --> 34:00.510
They're transferring me out of Liangjiang,

34:00.510 --> 34:01.750
You won't be lonely

34:02.720 --> 34:03.880
on your journey.

34:04.060 --> 34:05.680
We'll travel together.

34:12.510 --> 34:14.400
I was escorting the condemned official

34:14.400 --> 34:16.600
and had just left Liangjiang territory

34:17.800 --> 34:18.960
when the condemned official

34:18.960 --> 34:21.909
died from a severe illness in prison.

34:22.190 --> 34:23.719
His body has been cremated,

34:25.550 --> 34:27.750
and many witnesses can testify to this.

34:29.800 --> 34:31.630
During my post in Liangjiang,

34:32.030 --> 34:34.190
I obtained
the condemned official's confession

34:34.190 --> 34:35.360
and verified that

34:35.630 --> 34:38.510
the so-called enormous payment

34:38.630 --> 34:40.949
is merely gossip

34:41.070 --> 34:42.360
and baseless rumors,

34:42.790 --> 34:44.120
not worthy of credence.

34:44.760 --> 34:46.560
The condemned official is dead.

34:47.190 --> 34:48.000
I

34:48.480 --> 34:50.070
was negligent in my supervision

34:50.070 --> 34:52.130
and am willing to accept punishment.

34:53.630 --> 34:54.489
That's enough.

34:54.800 --> 34:56.060
Let's leave it at that.

34:56.630 --> 34:58.150
Go by land tomorrow

34:58.150 --> 35:00.480
and send it to the imperial court
by horse.

35:01.020 --> 35:02.930
[Rui Lin, Viceroy of Liangjiang]

35:03.800 --> 35:04.450
Sir.

35:05.000 --> 35:06.130
Is this sufficient?

35:06.360 --> 35:08.070
Isn't this a bit absurd?

35:11.190 --> 35:14.030
The imperial court
is desperately demanding money.

35:14.030 --> 35:16.080
Isn't that even more absurd?

35:42.730 --> 35:43.920
Make no mistake.

35:44.440 --> 35:45.640
You're already dead.

35:46.070 --> 35:47.930
When Rui Lin handed you over to me,

35:47.960 --> 35:49.420
you were already a corpse.

36:03.880 --> 36:04.680
Why is he here?

36:05.320 --> 36:06.720
He requested it himself.

36:08.150 --> 36:10.280
I thought you'd be at the foreign firm,

36:10.320 --> 36:12.320
hanging out with those foreigners.

36:12.760 --> 36:15.220
Whoever I associate with
is better than you.

36:15.360 --> 36:17.760
Everyone knows you're supposed to be dead.

36:18.920 --> 36:22.520
At least being dead means I won't
leave behind a shameful legacy.

36:22.590 --> 36:23.510
That's enough.

36:24.030 --> 36:26.230
You brothers argue the moment you meet.

36:26.240 --> 36:27.360
Young Master Li came specially

36:27.360 --> 36:28.360
to see you off.

36:28.650 --> 36:29.420
Otherwise?

36:29.550 --> 36:30.320
Otherwise,

36:31.030 --> 36:32.000
he would have gone with

36:32.000 --> 36:33.200
the Portuguese ship.

36:33.200 --> 36:33.920
Why leave?

36:34.000 --> 36:34.670
Where to?

36:37.840 --> 36:38.770
To see the world.

36:41.530 --> 36:42.630
I've been under this sky

36:42.630 --> 36:43.550
for too long.

36:46.840 --> 36:48.320
I want to see something new

36:50.360 --> 36:51.760
and learn something new.

36:55.320 --> 36:56.840
If the chance arises,

36:59.150 --> 37:00.410
I'll come back one day.

37:04.840 --> 37:06.100
Take care of yourself.

37:17.800 --> 37:18.440
I...

37:18.440 --> 37:19.240
I understand.

37:20.320 --> 37:21.150
I'll tend to

37:21.150 --> 37:22.810
your parents' graves for you.

37:23.600 --> 37:24.590
I'll tell your father

37:24.590 --> 37:25.650
where you've gone.

37:40.030 --> 37:40.510
Good.

37:41.110 --> 37:42.170
That would be nice.

37:54.500 --> 37:56.500
Are you still going back to grow tea?

37:57.190 --> 37:57.920
I don't know.

37:58.510 --> 37:59.320
I might take Yu'er

37:59.320 --> 38:00.380
and travel around.

38:01.300 --> 38:03.200
Or maybe change your name

38:03.880 --> 38:05.540
and continue doing business.

38:05.670 --> 38:06.290
Right?

38:08.760 --> 38:10.230
I just want my child to see me

38:10.230 --> 38:11.550
as soon as they open their eyes.

38:11.550 --> 38:12.280
Nothing is more important

38:12.280 --> 38:13.410
than that right now.

38:15.110 --> 38:16.230
Disheartened now?

38:17.030 --> 38:17.710
Not really.

38:19.400 --> 38:20.250
I may not be an official,

38:20.250 --> 38:22.110
but there's still work to be done.

38:22.150 --> 38:23.250
I just hope that in the future,

38:23.250 --> 38:23.880
everyone can

38:23.880 --> 38:25.400
live without fear

38:26.200 --> 38:28.330
and without betraying their dignity.

38:29.000 --> 38:30.530
May everyone under this sky

38:31.110 --> 38:32.800
live proudly and freely.

38:42.550 --> 38:44.480
Is King Li's Treasure really real?

38:57.280 --> 39:00.080
The winding mountains lead to
the Central Plains.

39:00.440 --> 39:01.920
When the time comes,

39:02.360 --> 39:03.760
it'll naturally emerge.

39:10.800 --> 39:12.060
Wealth is like the sea,

39:12.710 --> 39:14.170
and people are like boats.

39:14.960 --> 39:16.690
Though we rise and fall in life,

39:16.840 --> 39:18.240
we are merely passing by.

39:19.230 --> 39:20.420
Why care too much?

39:28.390 --> 39:35.240
♪ The wind brushes past the old eaves
on a cool night ♪

39:36.090 --> 39:42.550
♪ Look, the lanterns sway and cast shadow
of our overlapping silhouettes ♪

39:43.540 --> 39:51.740
♪ Forget about how long the path is ♪

39:52.940 --> 39:58.610
♪ This is etched into my soul,
unforgettable for life ♪

39:59.210 --> 40:02.670
♪ Names being etched
and centered in the time ♪

40:03.250 --> 40:06.520
♪ A goose flying across the barren plains,
carrying the setting sun's last light ♪

40:07.330 --> 40:14.640
♪ An old friend suddenly comes to mind,
and the world feels vast and desolate ♪

40:15.150 --> 40:18.760
♪ Here, I dreamed of you ♪

40:19.070 --> 40:22.680
♪ The candlelight casts the glow on me ♪

40:23.350 --> 40:30.600
♪ The rain soaks the paper umbrella;
the red mark on my sleeve spreads ♪

40:31.160 --> 40:34.430
♪ My heart races so fast
like a surging sea ♪

40:35.010 --> 40:38.650
♪ Longing sweeps through like starlight ♪

40:39.130 --> 40:46.710
♪The sword tassel has faded in color,
fallen petals cover my clothes ♪

40:47.390 --> 40:50.630
♪ You point toward the cooking smoke ♪

40:51.350 --> 40:54.650
♪ Saying time
has brewed its own fragrance ♪

40:55.330 --> 41:03.460
♪ Even when hair turns grey, we'll still
gaze at each other, fingers entwined ♪

41:04.420 --> 41:08.230
♪ The Milky Way spans the west window ♪

41:15.880 --> 41:21.490
[1903 AD]
[Shengxing United Chamber of Commerce]

41:22.620 --> 41:29.130
[Shengxing United Chamber of Commerce]

41:40.840 --> 41:42.120
Your Chinese friend

41:42.150 --> 41:43.210
has sent you a gift.

41:54.850 --> 41:56.430
[Gu]

41:58.880 --> 42:01.010
[Gu]

42:02.550 --> 42:03.320
Hu.

42:04.230 --> 42:05.290
After this battle,

42:05.880 --> 42:07.760
we've sacrificed blood for our homeland

42:07.760 --> 42:09.620
and crushed our enemy's courage.

42:10.360 --> 42:12.710
The Qing court is conducting
massive arrests.

42:12.710 --> 42:15.280
I'm glad you and our comrades

42:15.960 --> 42:16.890
escaped safely.

42:19.840 --> 42:22.040
Now the Qing Dynasty is on its last legs,

42:22.070 --> 42:23.000
and our Chinese nation

42:23.000 --> 42:23.920
cannot stand among

42:23.920 --> 42:25.380
the world's great powers.

42:25.440 --> 42:27.100
Only those with great ability

42:27.320 --> 42:28.590
can change our fate.

42:29.150 --> 42:31.010
Our 400 million compatriots must

42:31.030 --> 42:32.630
discard the old and embrace the new,

42:32.630 --> 42:34.130
become self-reliant and independent.

42:34.130 --> 42:35.110
Only then can we escape

42:35.110 --> 42:37.570
the fate of being carved up
and slaughtered.

42:38.320 --> 42:39.440
If our divine land sinks,

42:39.440 --> 42:40.480
and our civilization is lost,

42:40.480 --> 42:42.810
even dying nine times would not redeem us.

42:43.840 --> 42:46.570
I heard you're raising funds
for the revolution.

42:46.840 --> 42:48.190
I've enclosed a check.

42:49.070 --> 42:50.600
If the revolution falters,

42:50.630 --> 42:51.550
I will

42:52.000 --> 42:53.280
provide full support.

43:00.710 --> 43:04.870
[The End]
